    <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Terms & Conditions:</strong></span>

    <ol style="list-style: decimal; padding-left: 1rem;">
        <li>Fees once paid neither refundable nor transferable under any circumstances.</li>
        <li>Fees should be paid only through Institute&apos;s Bank Account number mentioned as above or by Cash at
            Institute&apos;s Cash Counter only & immediate money receipt to be obtained. Transfer of fees to any
            staff&apos;s A/c
            not allowed.</li>
        <li>Total Scholarship amount received from Govt. should be transferred to Institute&apos;s Bank A/c within
            15 days
            of receipt, otherwise Student&apos;s admission will be cancelled.</li>
        <li>Balance Course Fees should be paid monthly basis (on or before 15th of every month) or by Six equal
            instalments, failing which parents will be liable for delayed payment charges or readmission charges as per
            terms & conditions.</li>
        <li>Student should clear all the dues before the final Board examination Form Fillup. </li>
        <li>Composite fees excludes optional facilities like transport/ food hostel/ camps etc. will be charged
            separately. </li>
        <li>Uniforms, Books, stationary are not part of this fees structure.</li>
        <li>Examination conducted by Nursing Board will be charged separately (optional).</li>
        <li>Change of Branch can be possible within one month of admission. </li>
        <li>If any student left in mid-stream will liable to pay the balance fees for all the whole course even if
            left in mid-stream.</li>
    </ol>
